escription:\"Join public watch parties or create your own to enjoy movies and shows with others in real-time.\",signInRequired:\"Sign in to view public watch parties\",signInDescription:\"Join others watching movies and shows together\",signInButton:\"Sign In\",loadingParties:\"Loading watch parties...\",error:\"Error\",noPartiesAvailable:\"No public watch parties available\",noPartiesDescription:\"There are no public watch parties running right now.\",noPartiesHint:\"Start watching a movie or show and create your own public watch party!\",joinParty:\"Join Party\",justNow:\"Just now\",minuteAgo:\"minute ago\",minutesAgo:\"minutes ago\",hourAgo:\"hour ago\",hoursAgo:\"hours ago\",member:\"member\",members:\"members\",movie:\"Movie\",tvShow:\"TV Show\",partyHosted:\"'s Party\",season:\"Season\",episode:\"Episode\",joinToWatch:\"Join a party to watch and chat with others in real-time\",checkBackLater:\"Check back later for more watch parties\",closeAriaLabel:\"Close watch party overlay\"},g={title:\"What's New on FLIXER\",description:\"Stay up to date with the latest features, improvements, and updates.\",allCaughtUp:\"All caught up! Check back later for more updates.\",latest:\"Latest\",copy:\"Copy\",closeAriaLabel:\"Close notifications\"},m={title:\"Privacy & Data Collection\",description:\"We believe in transparency. Here's exactly what data we collect and why we're heavily anti-data collection.\",privacyPrinciplesTitle:\"Our Privacy Principles\",antiDataCollection:\"Anti-Data Collection\",antiDataCollectionDesc:\"We collect only the absolute minimum data necessary for functionality\",transparentStorage:\"Transparent Storage\",transparentStorageDesc:\"You can see and delete all your data through the settings overlay\",localFirst:\"Local First\",localFirstDesc:\"Guest users data stays on their device and is never transmitted to any servers\",whatWeCollectTitle:\"What We Collect\",withAccount:\"With Account\",withAccountDesc:\"Registered users\",withoutAccount:\"Without Account\",withoutAccountDesc:\"Guest users\",watchProgress:\"Watch Progress\",watchProgressDesc:\"Your viewing progress for movies and TV episodes\",watchProgressGuestNote:\"Stored locally only, not synced across devices\",accountInformation:\"Account Information\",accountInformationDesc:\"Username, bcrypt-hashed password (irreversible), avatar URL, and account creation date\",myListFavorites:\"My List & Favorites\",myListFavoritesDesc:\"Movies and TV shows you've added to your personal list\",watchHistory:\"Watch History\",watchHistoryDesc:\"Statistics about your viewing habits and streaks\",locationData:\"Location Data\",locationDataDesc:\"Country detection is disabled by default and must be enabled in settings. When enabled, only your country code is stored locally in cookies.\",locationDataGuestNote:\"Disabled by default - must be manually enabled in settings\",notCollected:\"Not collected\",passwordSecurityTitle:\"Password Security\",bcryptEncryption:\"Bcrypt Encryption\",bcryptEncryptionDesc:\"Military-grade password protection\",howWeProtect:\"How We Protect Your Password\",bcryptHashing:\"Bcrypt Hashing\",bcryptHashingDesc:\"Your password is hashed using bcrypt with salt rounds of 10\",uniqueSalt:\"Unique Salt\",uniqueSaltDesc:\"Each password gets a unique salt, preventing rainbow table attacks\",oneWayFunction:\"One-Way Function\",oneWayFunctionDesc:\"Bcrypt is irreversible - your original password cannot be recovered\",whatThisMeans:\"What This Means\",adminProtection:\"Admin Protection\",adminProtectionDesc:\"Even we (the owners) cannot see your actual password\",databaseSecurity:\"Database Security\",databaseSecurityDesc:\"If our database is compromised, passwords remain secure\",noRecovery:\"No Recovery\",noRecoveryDesc:\"We can only reset passwords, never retrieve them\",zeroKnowledgePassword:\"Zero-Knowledge Password Storage\",zeroKnowledgePasswordDesc:\"Your password is processed through bcrypt with 10 salt rounds, making it computationally infeas